---
// Homepage "Start here": the three ways to begin. No prices on the homepage (owner, 26 Nov 2026);
// prices live on /website-audit/ and /pricing/.
---
<section aria-labelledby="start-heading" class="bg-[var(--bg)] py-14 md:py-20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-center text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--accent)]">Start here</p>
    <h2 id="start-heading" class="mt-2 text-center font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--text)] sm:text-4xl">Three ways to begin, all online.</h2>

    <ul class="mt-9 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3" role="list">
      <li>
        <a href="/website-audit/" class="start tilt-card tilt-card--lg flex h-full flex-col p-6" style="--card-color: var(--ac-teal);">
          <span class="kicker">Website audit</span>
          <span class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">See what to fix first</span>
          <span class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-dim)]">Enquiry journeys, search visibility, speed, mobile and public security signals, reviewed by a person, with prioritised fixes.</span>
          <span class="cta mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-bold">Book an audit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/pricing/#booking-advance" class="start tilt-card tilt-card--lg flex h-full flex-col p-6" style="--card-color: var(--ac-indigo);">
          <span class="kicker">Book a project</span>
          <span class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--text)]">Reserve your project slot</span>
          <span class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-dim)]">Pay a secure booking advance online to reserve a discovery session and a place in our schedule.</span>
          <span class="cta mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-bold">Pay booking advance <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/get-quote/" class="start tilt-card tilt-card--lg flex h-full flex-col p-6 text-[var(--text)]" style="--card-color: var(--ac-amber);">
          <span class="kicker">Get a quote</span>
          <span class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-bold">Tell us what you need</span>
          <span class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-dim)]">We review quote requests within one business day and reply with the scope and next steps.</span>
          <span class="cta mt-auto pt-5 text-sm font-bold">Request a quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-5 text-center text-sm text-[var(--text-dim)]">Accessibility audits and website packages: see <a href="/pricing/" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">pricing</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Shared card style (owner, 27 Nov 2026), coloured per route. */
  .kicker { font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--card-color); }
  .cta { color: var(--card-color); }
  .start:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #6366f1; outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
